# **No artwork, and no measured corpora.** The reference library is built from private collections of illustrations; the
# distribution it produces is shared as tests/data/corpus_summary.json, and the images and the raw per-image records are
# not. Ignored here so that a corpus placed beside the code by habit cannot be committed by accident -- a rule that
# depends on remembering is not a rule.
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.webp
*.bmp
*.tif
*.tiff
*.gif
*.psd
*.fla
*.xfl
*.ai
*.svg
*.jsonl
